        q: "What battery brands do you supply in Dubai?",
        a: "We supply batteries from recognized manufacturers including Exide, Varta, Amaron, ACDelco, and Bosch, subject to vehicle specifications and [CONFIRM: current Bosch battery stock and other available brands]."
    },
    {
        q: "Does my car require an AGM battery?",
        a: "Vehicles with automatic start-stop systems, regenerative braking, or heavy electrical options require an AGM or EFB battery. Installing a standard flooded battery in an AGM-specified vehicle will cause premature battery failure within months and may trigger electrical warning faults."
    },
    {
        q: "What factors determine car battery replacement costs in Dubai?",
        a: "Pricing depends on battery technology (standard flooded, EFB, or AGM), physical group size, amp-hour (Ah) capacity, brand warranty, and whether battery registration via OBD-II scanner is required for your vehicle's power management system."
    },
    {
        q: "Could my starting problem be caused by something other than the battery?",
        a: "Yes. Faulty starter motors, failing alternator diodes, loose grounding cables, or parasitic electrical drains can mimic a dead battery. Our technicians test your charging and starting circuits before installing a new battery to ensure the real issue is resolved."
